      <li>Encrypted export and import: the export is still the inherited one, with no import</li>
      <li>Reminders to log a day: a message template, never scheduled</li>
      <li>Integration and end-to-end tests: unit tests only</li>
      <li>Cloud sync and the stretch goal: not attempted</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="caption">
      Repository history: <a href={ephira.repo.href}>{ephira.repo.text}</a>
    </p>
  </div>
  <Notes time="0:45" cue="Ask: which amber card would you have checked with the partner first?">
    <p>
      From the repository history over the team's three terms. Two Release
      1 cards didn't land: the encrypted export and import, an amber card,
      and the log reminders, a known one.
    </p>
    <p>
      The proposal asked for push notifications; the team scheduled the
      period alerts on the phone instead, which settles the amber card in
